# Course identity: map-coordinate fixture to existing node for room 111.
# No node assignment, completion, exit, sprite, event or save edits.
# Clean-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No WRAM pokes or imported savestates. All waits are guest-frame counts.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 1f11 0000
poke 1f17 2801a8012801a801
poke 1f1f 12001a0012001a00
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
dump node
press y 2
until 0100 == 14 500
dump active
wait 120
dump later
quit
